WEBVTT

00:03:56.411 --> 00:04:00.416
if we're serious about reaching
our 2050 objective,

00:04:00.440 --> 00:04:01.663
which we are.

00:04:02.580 --> 00:04:07.693
And second, the more we progress,
the more we rally.

00:04:08.364 --> 00:04:12.267
Our 2030 and 2050
time lines are ambitious.

00:04:13.180 --> 00:04:14.813
They are also necessary.

00:04:15.960 --> 00:04:20.857
Solving climate change
will help solve a host of other problems.

00:04:21.370 --> 00:04:25.635
Ignoring it will only precipitate them,

00:04:25.659 --> 00:04:29.016
as we see with the link
between the loss of biodiversity

00:04:29.040 --> 00:04:31.973
and zoonotic viruses like the coronavirus.